flowchart TD
  Z[Both devices on the<br/>same Wi-Fi network] --> A
  A[Device A<br/>Settings or onboarding: Start Hosting] --> B[Shows an IP<br/>address and code]
  C[Device B<br/>Join: enter IP and code] --> D[Connect and authenticate]
  B --> D
  D --> E{Same memory model<br/>installed on both?}
  E -- No --> F[Prompt to download<br/>the embedding model]
  F --> D
  E -- Yes: Ready --> G[Device A confirms<br/>the transfer]
  G --> H[End to end encrypted transfer]
  H --> H2[Chats, characters, personas,<br/>memories, settings, avatars<br/>and banner crop framing]
  H2 --> I[Device B reloads<br/>with the synced data]
  I --> J[Devices disconnect<br/>nothing is kept online]

  classDef warn fill:#3b2f14,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#fef3c7;
  class E,F warn;
  classDef accent fill:#14532d,stroke:#4ade80,color:#f0fdf4;
  class H,H2 accent;
